    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a very stout kind of leather made of ox-hide, dressed with oil, and having a characteristic fuzzy surface, and a dull whitish-yellow color (OED s.v. buff n.2 2a) | a very stout kind of leather made of ox-hide, dressed with oil, and having a characteristic fuzzy surface, and a dull whitish-yellow color (OED s.v. buff n.2 2a &amp; 8) | a very stout kind of leather made of ox-hide, dressed with oil, and having a characteristic fuzzy surface, and a dull whitish-yellow color (OED s.v. buff n.^2 2a)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
